      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2753,
      "bookHadithIndex": 23,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Miljaz:that a man sat in the middle of a circle so Hudhaifah said: \"Cursed upon the tongue of Muhammad - or - Cursed, by Allah upon the tongue of Muhammad (ﷺ), is he who sits in the middle of a the circle",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2753-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
