      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2754,
      "bookHadithIndex": 24,
      "text": "Narrated Anas:\"There was no person more beloved to them than the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ).\" [He said:] \"And they would not stand when they saw him because they knew that he disliked that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2754-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2754-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2754-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2754-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bcf5",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2755,
      "bookHadithIndex": 25,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Miljaz:that Mu'awiyah came out and 'Abdullah bin Az-Zubair and Ibn Safwan stood for him when they saw him, so he said: \"Sit, I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) saying: 'Whoever wishes that he be received by men standing then, let him take his seat in the Fire",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2755-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2755-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2755-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bcf6",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2756,
      "bookHadithIndex": 26,
      "text": "Narrated Abu Hurairah:that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"Five are from the Fitrah: Cutting the pubic hair, circumcision, paring the mustache, plucking the under arm hair and trimming the fingernails",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2756-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2756-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2756-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bcf7",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2757,
      "bookHadithIndex": 27,
      "text": "Narrated 'Aishah:that the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"Ten are from the Fitrah: Paring the mustache, leaving the beard to grow, Siwak, cleaning the nose with water, paring the fingernails, washing the knuckles, plucking the underarm hair, shaving the pubic hairs, and Intiqas with water",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2757-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2757-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2757-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2757-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bcf8",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2758,
      "bookHadithIndex": 28,
      "text": "Narrated Anas:from the Prophet (ﷺ), that he (ﷺ) fixed the time as every forty nights for them to trimming the fingernails, taking from the mustache, and shaving the pubic hairs",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2758-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2758-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2758-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bcf9",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2759,
      "bookHadithIndex": 29,
      "text": "Narrated Anas bin Malik:\"[The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)] fixed the time for us paring the mustache, trimming the fingernails, shaving the pubic hairs and plucking the underarm hairs - that we not leave it for more than forty days",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2759-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
