      "hadithIndex": 2767,
      "bookHadithIndex": 37,
      "text": "Narrated Jabir:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) prohibited Ishtimal As-Samma, Al-Ihtiba in one garment, and that a man raise one of his feet atop the other while he is reclining on his back",
