    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd07",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2773,
      "bookHadithIndex": 43,
      "text": "Narrated 'Abdullah bin Buraidah:\"I heard my father Buraidah saying: 'I was walking with the Prophet (ﷺ) when a man came to him with a donkey, so he said: \"O Messenger of Allah! Ride\" and the man moved toward the back. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"No, you have more right to the front of your beast, unless you allot it for me.\" He said: \"I have allotted it for you.'\" He said: 'So he rode",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2773-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2773-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2773-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2773-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd08",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2774,
      "bookHadithIndex": 44,
      "text": "Narrated Jabir:that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"Do you have Anmat?\" I said: \"Where would we get Anmat from?\" He said: \"Soon you will have Anmat\" He said: \"I would say to my wife: 'Remove your Anmat from my sight.' But she would say: 'Did not the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) say: \"Indeed you shall soon have Anmat?\" He said: \"So I left it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2774-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2774-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2774-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2774-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd09",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2775,
      "bookHadithIndex": 45,
      "text": "Narrated Iyas bin Salamah:from his father who said: \"I guided Allah's Prophet (ﷺ) and Al-Hasan and Al-Husain, on his gray mule until I brought him to the apartment of the Prophet (ﷺ), this one was in front of him, and this one behind him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2775-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2775-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2775-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2775-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd0a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2776,
      "bookHadithIndex": 46,
      "text": "Narrated Jabir bin 'Abdullah:\"I asked the Messenger Of Allah (ﷺ) about the unintentional glance, so he ordered me that I divert my sight",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2776-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2776-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2776-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2776-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd0b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2777,
      "bookHadithIndex": 47,
      "text": "Narrated Ibn Buraidah:from his father (from the Prophet (ﷺ)) who said: \"O 'Ali! Do not follow a look with a look, the first is for you, but the next is not for you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2777-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2777-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2777-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd0c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2778,
      "bookHadithIndex": 48,
      "text": "Narrated Nabhan the freed slave of Umm Salamah:to Ibn Shihab, that Umm Salamah narrated to him, that she and Maimunah were with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), she said: \"So when we were with him, Ibn Umm Maktum came, and he entered upon him, and that was after veiling had been ordered for us. So the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'Veil yourselves from him.' So I said: 'O Messenger of Allah! Is he not blind such that he can not see us or recognize us?' So the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'Are you two blind such that you can not see him?",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2778-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2778-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2778-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2778-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd0d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2779,
      "bookHadithIndex": 49,
      "text": "Narrated Dhakwan:from the freed slave of 'Amr bin Al-'As that 'Amr bin Al-'As sent him to 'Ali seeking his permission to enter upon Asma bint Umais, so he permitted him. When he was finished from what he needed, the freed slave of 'Amr bin Al-'As asked about that, so he said: \"Indeed the Prophet (ﷺ) prohibited us - or - prohibited that we enter upon women, without the permission of their husbands",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2779-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2779-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2779-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-43-2779-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bd0e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 43,
      "hadithIndex": 2780,
      "bookHadithIndex": 50,
      "text": "Narrated Usamah bin Zaid, and Sa'eed bin Zaid bin 'Amr bin Nufail:that the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"I have not left among the people after me, a Fitnah more harmful upon men than women",
